      + sec('nesting', 'Corners inside a card', '<p>Fields and buttons inside a card keep their own corner. The card’s corner is twice theirs, and its padding (<code class="cs-lchip">l</code>) is wider than either, so the inner corners always look nested, never tighter than the card’s.</p>')
